	(text "19 V input: redundant 19 V bus, tapped upstream of the per-node hot-swap channels -> PTC, TVS, reverse-polarity Schottky -> LMR51430 buck (1.1 MHz) -> 5.2 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f11b8c9a-2abe-4ef6-b2dc-089a3a6d5b27")
	)
	(text "BUCK_5V = 0.6 V x (1 + 100k/12.4k) = 5.44 V, so +5V is ~5.0 V loaded after D2. D9 SMAJ6.0A crowbars BUCK_5V if U8 fails short (F3 trips). SMAJ22A clamps below the LMR51430 38 V abs max."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "54617621-5a63-4dd6-ab6f-a7ddbc80c2f2")
	)
	(text "C2: molded tantalum-polymer instead of an aluminium-polymer can (no rubber seal; immersion, docs/controller.md). 5 V on 10 V = 50 % of rating."
